{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S01、S03、S06等段落的感受短语较密集，纵向交替扫读不如Y左右分栏来得直观，短时间内容易有局部阅读负担。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏更容易一眼区分人物叙事和音乐感受，扫读成本较低。但X通过【】突出每段的心理转折，又用按音乐时刻出现的感受把情绪变化和具体乐句联系起来，让观众不仅知道他在想什么，还能理解他为什么反复动摇。尤其从怀念、愤懑、孤独、重新理解自己到带着想念继续生活，X的心理递进和音乐细节更完整，人物前后的变化也更有说服力。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4fb6cfac-fef0-4fb4-9a80-774d72954a4f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011821698538Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:19:28.014827+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fdafc05807311b4c2e0a77468b8748c802f7e90c2622f5ed62ab23afdb9d70da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":